"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:m0144","surface":"元瑜","start":144,"end":146,"person_id":"pkw_eqh_gnj","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007","text":"近別之後，將隔暄寒，思子爲勞，未能忘弭。昔李叟入秦，梁生適越，猶懷悵恨，且或吟謠；況歧路之日，將離嚴網，辭無可憐，罪有不測。蓋畫地刻木，昔人所惡，叢棘旣累，於何可聞，所以握手戀戀，離別珍重。弟愛同鄒季，淫淫承睫，吾猶復抗手分背，羞學婦人。素鐘肇節，金飆戒序，起居無恙，動靜履宜。子雲筆札，元瑜書記，信用旣然，可樂爲甚。且使目明，能祛首疾。甚善甚善。","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:m0021","surface":"李叟","start":21,"end":23,"person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"送別所用入秦典，此句未明其名。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:m0026","surface":"梁生","start":26,"end":28,"person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"適越故事，未僅憑梁姓擬名。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:m0098","surface":"鄒季","start":98,"end":100,"person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"書稱弟愛同鄒季，用於比擬，非何炯為僧孺親弟之據。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:m0139","surface":"子雲","start":139,"end":141,"person_id":"5bd_a4e_ad6","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangsengru:p007:m0144","surface":"元瑜","start":144,"end":146,"person_id":"pkw_eqh_gnj","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1514481,"source_layer":"